  multiforest-extension-surface: PLAN COMMITTED
    docs/plans/multiforest-extension-surface.md (artifacts
    .claude/multiforest-extension-surface-design/). The answer to
    VD's "a multiforest ABI/API model writers would want": the DRIVER
    surface (caller-owned outer loop) is the shape and is nearly
    shipped - the missing piece is the documented contract; the
    declarative per-forest BASIS is the model-carrying surface, with
