  multiforest-mutation-gaps: guards landed (record in
    docs/plans/multiforest-mutation-gaps.md); the weight channel
    (exact-zero multiplier snap + caller-settable per-forest weight)
    landed via docs/plans/zero-weight-exactness.md, which also
