    classes may want different shapes). Design-gated, NOT scheduled
    (VD: revisit on a second consumer or a release want).
    monotoneTreeIsFeasible's 1e-9: deliberately left (it is the
    acceptance predicate of the constrained-prior rejection sampler,
    a one-sided feasibility slack, not an equality tolerance).
  multiforest-predictor-mutation: the survey's most valuable door -
    per-observation/transactional predictor mutation on multi-forest
    samplers (latent-covariate causal forests: bairrtt's
    irt_causal_bart with latent ability as a treatment moderator,
